# Keeps the Railway/BuildKit build context small and, critically, prevents
# `tsconfig.tsbuildinfo` and `.next/` from landing in the image — Nixpacks
# mounts cache *directories* at those paths and the build fails if a file or
# stale directory is already there.

node_modules
.next
out
dist
dist-ssr
*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store

*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.local.example

README.md
eas.json
